meta {
  name: Create analysis run
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/children/{{childId}}/analysis-runs
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "sources": [
      {
        "sourceType": "IepDocument",
        "sourceId": {{iepDocumentId}}
      },
      {
        "sourceType": "EtrDocument",
        "sourceId": {{etrDocumentId}}
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # POST /api/children/{childId}/analysis-runs

  Queues a new analysis run over one or more documents for this child and enqueues it for background
  execution (`GetById`/`GetByChild` poll for completion — this endpoint does not wait for the run to
  finish). Body is `CreateAnalysisRunRequest`. Rate-limited (`analysis-run` policy): 20 requests per
  15 minutes per user.

  ## Body

  - `sources` (required, 1+, max 5) — each entry is `{ sourceType, sourceId }`.
    - `sourceType` — `IepDocument | EtrDocument | ProgressReport` (case-insensitive string, not the
      numeric enum). `SharedDraftRevision` is a valid `AnalysisSourceType` elsewhere in the app but is
      never accepted here — it feeds a separate lightweight explanation path, not this engine.
    - `sourceId` — must belong to this child; a source that doesn't resolve is dropped with a warning
      rather than failing the whole request (see `message` below).
  - Duplicate `{ sourceType, sourceId }` entries are combined into one, noted in `message`.
  - The 5-entry max is counted on `sources` as submitted, *before* de-duplication — `[MaxLength(5)]`
    on `CreateAnalysisRunRequest.Sources`. Five identical entries (deduped to one) is fine; six entries
    of any kind, even six copies of the same source, fails model validation. See the `400` entry below
    for the distinct response shape this produces.

  ## Responses

  - `201` — `Location: /api/children/{childId}/analysis-runs/{runId}`; `data: AnalysisRunDto` with
    `status: "Pending"`, each listed source `status: "Pending"`, and `sections: []` (nothing has run
    yet). `message` carries a non-fatal warning when sources were deduped or silently dropped (e.g.
    "Duplicate documents were selected and have been combined.").
  - `400` — two distinct shapes:
    - More than 5 entries in `sources` fails `[MaxLength(5)]` model validation. Because this
      controller is `[ApiController]`-annotated, ASP.NET Core's automatic model-validation filter
      returns its own `ValidationProblemDetails` body *before* the action method runs — not the
      `ApiResponse` envelope every other response on this endpoint uses:
      `{ "errors": { "Sources": ["Choose up to 5 documents for one analysis."] }, "title": "One or more validation errors occurred.", "status": 400, ... }`.
    - Every other `400` is an `ApiResponse<object>` with `success: false` and the failure in `message`:
      no `sources`, an invalid `sourceType` string, "Child not found." (only for a child the caller has
      access to that has since been deactivated — see `403` below for a child that doesn't exist or
      the caller can't access at all), the per-child analysis limit reached (5 runs — `message`:
      "Analysis limit reached for this child.", unrelated to the 5-source-per-request cap above), or
      every selected source failed to resolve.
  - `401` — missing/invalid bearer token.
  - `402` — "Active subscription required." (billed to the child profile's owner, not the caller).
  - `403` — the Collaborator+ access check runs before the child is loaded, so this covers both "no
    access at all" and "access below Collaborator" (e.g. Viewer) for any `childId` — including one that
    doesn't exist, which resolves to the same "no role found" as no access.
  - `429` — `analysis-run` rate limit (20 requests / 15 minutes per user); empty body, no
    `OnRejected` handler is configured for this policy.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Analysis run queued",
    "data": {
      "id": 101,
      "childProfileId": 1,
      "status": "Pending",
      "overallSummary": null,
      "crossDocSynthesis": null,
      "overallRedFlags": [],
      "advocacyGapAnalysis": null,
      "parentGoalsSnapshot": [],
      "sources": [
        { "id": 201, "sourceType": "IepDocument", "sourceId": 35, "sourceLabel": "IEP dated 2026-05-01", "status": "Pending", "errorMessage": null },
        { "id": 202, "sourceType": "EtrDocument", "sourceId": 9, "sourceLabel": "ETR dated 2026-03-15", "status": "Pending", "errorMessage": null }
      ],
      "sections": [],
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-02T14:00:00Z"
    },
    "errors": []
  }
  ```
}
